      "recoding": "fit-fold levels -> 0..k-1 (sorted), missing -> k, unseen -> k+1",
      "uncertainty": "paired fold differences; corrected_ci95 uses Nadeau-Bengio variance s^2(1/n + 1/(k-1))"
